{"name":"Shoun","status":"ok","title":"Shoun","pageId":48652,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about the <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a> realm. For the dynasty from <a href=\"/wiki/Calimshan\" title=\"Calimshan\">Calimshan</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Shoon\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Shoon\">Shoon</a>.</i></div> \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Shoun</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luiren\" title=\"Luiren\">Luiren</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Southeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Southeast Faerûn\">southeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"demonym\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Demonym</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Shounite<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p63_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p63-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"established\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Established</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">116</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Shoun\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Shoun\">Inhabitants of  Shoun</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Locations in Shoun (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX1Nob3VuP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Locations in  Shoun</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Shoun\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Shoun\">Organizations in  Shoun</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Shoun&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  in  Shoun</a></span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Shoun</b> was a settlement in the <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a> realm of <a href=\"/wiki/Luiren\" title=\"Luiren\">Luiren</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shoun?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Shoun was located on <a href=\"/wiki/Luirenstrand\" title=\"Luirenstrand\">Luirenstrand</a> on the coast of the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Sea\" title=\"Great Sea\">Great Sea</a> in eastern Luiren. Shoun was the port nearest to <a href=\"/wiki/Passion_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Passion Island\">Passion Island</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was the terminus from a road leading to <a href=\"/wiki/Beluir\" title=\"Beluir\">Beluir</a>, as well as the beginning of a trail leading to <a href=\"/wiki/Ormpe\" title=\"Ormpe\">Ormpe</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Estagund\" title=\"Estagund\">Estagund</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shoun?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Melino_Richtoes\" title=\"Melino Richtoes\">Melino Richtoes</a> was the mayor of Shoun in <a href=\"/wiki/1367_DR\" title=\"1367 DR\">1367 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shoun?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Shoun was founded by halflings in <a href=\"/wiki/116_DR\" title=\"116 DR\">116 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p63_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p63-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The settlement sported a host of bakeries, eventually giving rise to the phrase \"fat as a Shounite\" throughout Luiren. Additionally, famous dairies were supplied by goats, which were kept north of the city. It was even rumored that <a href=\"/wiki/Luiren_spring_cheese\" title=\"Luiren spring cheese\">Luiren spring cheese</a> originated here.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shoun?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shoun?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a>&#160;(June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>). ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\">0-7869-1836-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-2\">2.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-3\">2.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tom_Prusa\" title=\"Tom Prusa\">Tom Prusa</a>&#160;(1993). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shining_South_(1993)\" title=\"The Shining South (1993)\">The Shining South</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 48. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/1-56076-595-X\" title=\"Special:BookSources/1-56076-595-X\">1-56076-595-X</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-tGHotR-p63-3